{"server":"en","storyId":"story_lava_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_lava_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"'Caring'","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"Interlude","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_lava_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"2f2057cd6eeefb8f4141614091f570ea63b8235112a9f234add8037c4101d90c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"Tick—tick—tick—tick—\nTick—tick—tick—tick—\nTick—tick—tick—tick—\nBang."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Augh... shut up..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Hibiscus, time to get up."},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"You're not even gonna answer?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"No way you're thinking of lying in."},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"You sent me a message yesterday saying you were making rounds or something. That I should wake you up in the morning."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"And here I am awake, and you're still sleeping. Haaah..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Eh, sleep in all you want. I'm gonna go rinse up."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Hm?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Hibiscus, you're still sleeping?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Wanna get up?"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"I just got back from field work myself. The mission wasn't easy. A huge hassle, actually. Not many people other than me could deal with it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"And Amiya gave me a hell of a lot of off days for it, so now I can sleep in for the whole day."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"If I wasn't getting you up, I could've gotten a lot more sleep. Haaah..."},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Still asleep?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Then I've got to do something or other."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"You said yourself last night, you were one of the Medical Department's elite at this point. You can't be late. I'll drag you out if I have to."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Though saying that isn't a first for me..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"But having the chance to actually drag you out from your covers would be."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Hm-hmmm. What in the world would you do without me?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Still not getting up? I'm seriously gonna pull 'em. If you catch a cold, don't blame me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Hibi—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Hibiscus, what—what's up with you?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Why are your hands so hot?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Hibiscus? Sis? Don't kid me like this. Haven't you always been pretty healthy?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Why would you just..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Sis! Sis! Say something!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm awake... Lava..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Stop shaking me..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, s—sorry."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you okay?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"A little chilly... and weak..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Probably caught a fever..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Fever? Your body can do that?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, right!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Just wait for me a moment, I'll go and find a doctor for you right now!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"It's no big deal... Lava, you don't need to..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh... honestly, you..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Ten minutes later..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Hibiscus, I found a doctor for you!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ansel, you need to take a look quick! Is she alright?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Wait, calm down—ack, stop pulling me like that—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"Good grief... I thought you had something urgent you needed to drag me out for. I see it was your sister."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"It's n... nothing..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"The sick aren't qualified to say it's 'nothing.'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"Do you have a thermometer in your dormitory?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"We—We do!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"In our household medicine box..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll go and get it!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't rush."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"It's just... a fever..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"Hrmm."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"Temperature's a little high."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"And you're unable to exert strength?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Mm-hm..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Medicine box! Come on! I remember it was here!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"Have your diet and work-rest balance been fine these past few days?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Health..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"Healthy meals."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"Okay, forget I ever asked."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"You and Folinic are both the type that don't call for worrying."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"You've likely been too exhausted as of recent."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Found it!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Do the necessary... tests too... in a bit, please..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"That way she can... feel a little calmer..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"I understand."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Here, the thermometer!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"Please bring the whole chest over. I can administer Hibiscus all the fundamental tests that way."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"A medical kit of hers should contain the necessary equipment."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Got it!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"With sufficient supporting data, I'll be able to discern whether her high temperature is a protective bodily response, or whether some other symptom has had knock-on complications."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"We'll start with temperature. Here, open wide."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"Aaah—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"H—How is she?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"No great cause for worry. Her body is just self-regulating somewhat aggressively."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"Overexhaustion should be the main cause."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"As long as she rests up for the next few days, she'll be back again in no time."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"She'll want a bit of a lighter diet, reduced salt and sugar intake, and to pay mind to balanced nutrition."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"So you're saying I've gotta make healthy meals for her..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"The cafeteria can provide similar meals. You might not necessarily have to make them yourself."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"As for other major points, Hibiscus knows more than well enough, so I won't go listing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll file Hibiscus' sick leave for her at the Medical Department. Fang will tell the others."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"The both of you shouldn't have any field work or missions lined up for the next couple of days, correct."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't, no."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"None..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"Then there shouldn't be any problem."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ansel","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"If you don't have any particular questions, then I'll be on my way. I'll leave you to watch over her, Lava."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Hey—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"So I gotta look after you for a day or two, then."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Ah..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"I never took any sort of nursing class."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Lava... if you want to train... go train..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Your sister's... a doctor... she's not that weak..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"She can look after... herself..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"*Cough*, *cough* *cough*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"That's enough out of you! Does your throat hurt? Do you need some water?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"It's okay..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Look, I, uh, I wasn't—I'm not saying I don't wanna look after you!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"It's just, that, I, I don't really have experience..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"So if I get any part wrong. If you're uncomfortable."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Then tell me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Lava..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Okay..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Then we're doing this. You need to eat breakfast first. I'll go make some in a moment. I'll do the dishes after we're done."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Is your appetite gonna be a problem?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"It won't..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Want me to get a washbowl first, then, so you can wash your face and stuff?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"(Nods)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Just give me a moment."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"(Pulls at a corner of Lava's hem)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh. Is there anything else?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"(Mouths a 'thank you')"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Nothing to thank me for. You got ill. I'm off for a couple days. It pretty much works out."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Uh, where'd that washbowl from before go?\n......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Phew... finally, all done..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Jeez, nursing's rougher than I thought. I don't feel cool at all."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"If you asked me to do this in front of everyone else, I'd refuse point blank."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you full?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"(Nods)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Then you can go back to sleep now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Close your eyes, and get some proper rest."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll wash out the bowl, and then I'll go do the dishes, and then—not sure."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Eh, anyhow, for now that's that. If you need anything, set the alarm on this clock to go off. I'll come right over when I hear it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Be good."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"(Pats Hibiscus's face)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Mmnn... brush, washing-up liquid."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"(Did I give Hibiscus's face a pat just then?)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mum and dad'll miss you.\nDon't forget to write to us.\nBe good."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmph..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"(Mum and dad love treating us like that.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"(Not sure if they've gotten the letter from last week yet.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"(Mm... is that how Hibiscus treats me too?)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"You need to eat healthy meals."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Be good."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"(Ugh...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"(Whenever she acts like that, chances are she's trying to boss me around.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"(......)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"(I don't know if that one bowl of meat porridge was enough to fill her.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"(Should I peel her a piece of fruit too?)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"(Or maybe roast some meat?)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"(I really wanna set up a stove right by her bed and barbecue meat for myself.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"(Make her starve drooling.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"(......)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"(Let's go with peeling fruit, yeah...)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"I sliced some fruit for you. Do you want it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Zzz..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Sleeping pretty heavy, huh."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Weird, actually, how she doesn't look all that loathsome when she's asleep."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"(Pinches Hibiscus's face)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Zzz..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Still running high."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Hope she'll recover a little soon. That way I can prank her with a completely clean conscience."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Haaah... I've been busy half the day. I'm a little tired myself now..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Guess I can nap a little by her side..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Zzz..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Tick—tick—tick—tick—\nTick—tick—tick—tick—\nTick—tick—tick—tick—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Tick—tick—tick—tick—\nBang."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Did that wake you up? Sorry..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"It's the alarm I set for your porridge."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"I..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Do you want it right now, or in a bit?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Now, I guess."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Lemme get it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Ah-ah-ah, don't get up. You knocked out all the way from yesterday to today and now you want to be up and about?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Lie—down—for—me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Weagh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"(When did Hibiscus get this strong?)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"I asked around a little. It was Pith who got you into this state after taking you out for special training."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"This isn't Miss Pith's fault."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"This was going to be a high-intensity training session, anyway. It might look pretty ruthless at first, but nothing ever starts smooth. I'll be fine after I'm used to it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Still, you can't wreck yourself with training like this..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"I think it's worth it. I can feel how I'm getting stronger, Originium Arts precision or otherwise, training like this."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Besides..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Besides?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"I was warned about this training, going into it. It'd be majorly intense, it'd be tough making it through and I'd need a good mentality and so on."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"I told the instructors: 'It's fine. My sister's a medic. Even if I end up half dead, as long as I still have breath in me, she'll bring me back.'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"More or less how it went. You get the idea."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Lava."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"What?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll overlook it this time, but if you end up like this after special training again, I'll officially raise dissent with the HR department."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"You don't need to—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't care what kind of improvement you might get out of this. It only matters to me whether this is going to damage your health."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"No matter what, you can't..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm sorry..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Hibiscus? Sis?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't—don't cry. C'mon, look at how big you are."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Do you know how worried I was when I found you?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm alright, aren't I...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Just a little overdraft on my strength. And a few grazes."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"No, not this..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Do you still remember... how you ended up at Rhodes Island...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"That..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"I helped a bunch of merchants repel some bandits, and someone noticed I was an Infected..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Then their caravan dumped me... and I remember someone or other bashed my head in. Then I passed out."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"And when I woke up again, I was aboard Rhodes Island."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"And somebody'd healed my injuries."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"I heard an operator in the field picked me up on the way back? Lucky thing I was only minorly injured. Wasn't much trouble for others."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"They were heavy injuries..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"I thought, after I lost touch with you, the next time we met, you'd still be the same awkward you, but..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Then you were on the operating table, Lava—burnt up like a fireball..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"I couldn't... do anything to help..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"The only thing I could do was—attend to you after the operation... just like now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"You were—crying my name, non-stop, in your bed..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"What? Wait, I never heard about this before..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Then—Then why didn't you tell me—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Because I knew you'd act out if you got awkward! It was so tough just finding you. What if you just ran away again?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"So before you recovered and officially came on board, I didn't even dare show up."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm not—I'm not that unreasonable."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Of course you are!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"You got lost when we left Victoria BECAUSE you were being so difficult, Lava!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"That—That was an accident..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"In any case, you can't let anything like this happen again. Do you understand?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"(Quietly) Okay..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Mm-hm. There's a good girl."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, that's right. What were you dreaming about?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"If you don't mind, you're safe to share some of your dreams with your sister. It'll be good for your recuperation."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Mm-hm. I'm listening."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"I... I saw..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"What did you see?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"I saw you..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Was there anything about me?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"You were..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Go on. I'm listening."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"(Pats Lava's face)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmuh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Go on, then. What did you dream of?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"(I can't, this is too embarrassing! I can't say it!)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Nothing!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Nothing at all!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Be good."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"I won't!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"I didn't have a single dream!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"How can you be so difficult right after waking up, Lava?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"*Sigh*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Being difficult isn't anything new. Why is your face so red, though?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Did you manage to get a fever too?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Nope!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Just lie down now, and I'll take your temperature."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"What do you need my temperature for?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't bring the thermometer over, I don't have a fever! It's nothing!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"The sick aren't qualified to say it's 'nothing.'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Can't you tell the difference between a fever and blushing?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Why would I be making you blush?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Be—Because it'd be so embarrassing having to tell you how you were so ill in my dream you couldn't even speak, duh!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Uh."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"That's more... or less how it went..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Heheh. Hearing that actually makes me pretty happy."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"It's because usually... like, sis, you're..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"I'd never be taken out that easily."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Mm, but it's always hard to expect the unexpected. So in future, I really might need you to look after me, Lava."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Of course, I've always believed you'll be there to help your sister out in bad times."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Even if you usually never listen and you're always so obstinate, you have plenty of ideas, and you're always fast to act."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Is this just a really roundabout way of criticizing me...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"It isn't."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"*Sigh*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Fine."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Do you have anything to eat? I'm a little hungry."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Yep, I do."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"This is wonderful. It's not everyday we can get along so well."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Just wait a moment. I'll bring it over for you."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"(So back then, she was there too, huh.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"(I wondered why there was a voice that sounded so familiar.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"(......)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"(If not for Mr. Johann teaching me, Hibiscus wouldn't have seen me again...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"(I've got no idea how he's doing these days in Leithanien. Someone as talented at music as him probably got famous by now.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"(Maybe a letter...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"(I don't know when mum and dad'll send a reply...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"(Everyone's... going through really rough times...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"(If I could just be more powerful, then...)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Here we go, now. Here's some porridge, fresh off the flame. Eat it while it's hot."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"(Sniffs it)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"It doesn't really smell like anything. Isn't it meat porridge?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"In your dreams, it was. This is cutting-edge healthy porridge. Healthy AND tasty!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"(Healthy?!)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"You—wait, hold on, did you put in that weird healthy powder or whatever it was you made?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"That's right. It'll be easier to absorb, and faster to deliver nutrients to your body."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Let me just ask, first... have you tasted it yourself...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Of course I have~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"I eat three square meals a day, and my nutrition's especially well-balanced. That's why it's you who gets ill and not your sister, you know."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Here, try it. Healthiness is the most important thing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't wanna. I'm not gonna have a single spoonful."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"I went to a lot of pains improving it. Just give it a try."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Like I'm gonna trust you! You said you improved it last time, and it still wasn't—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Here!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Wmmhphh!!!!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Mmph?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"It's like it... tastes... kind of tolerable now?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Riiight~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Mm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"?!?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Eugh, no."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Nononono, what's up with this aftertaste?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Urp—don't tell me you just delayed the taste and called that better!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hibiscus","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"That's right. You can drink all the porridge in one gulp now, can't you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Hibiscus, we are NOT done!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Bleuch..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lava","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"Mark my words! I am... eugh... NOT done with you!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["Hibiscus","Lava"]},{"speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","aliases":["Hibiscus"]},{"speakerId":"char_121_lava","aliases":["Lava"]},{"speakerId":"char_212_ansel","aliases":["Ansel"]}]}
